++++++      "body": "Request changes on PR #132 (build(0003)). The preflight parked gate (c) on the test target: tests/test_policy_skills.py::test_security_baseline_check_finds_secrets_and_dangerous_calls fails because template/lessons/README.md line 87 reads \"the lesson and the eval (/sdlc-deploy step 0b)\" and the security-baseline scanner's pattern eval\\s*\\( matches the prose \"eval (\". Reword the sentence so the word \"eval\" is never followed by an opening parenthesis, for example \"the lesson and the eval case, in /sdlc-deploy step 0b\", and check the rest of the README and the two command files for the same shape. Then finish phase (c): the adversarial verdict, gate (c) and the PR summary, which the first run did not reach (it hit the 200-turn cap after the verifier's evidence). No other change.",
