 ## Fix
-<what changed and where; the runbook that ran, if one did, and whether it was the right call>
+<what changed and where; the runbook that ran, if one did, and whether it was the right
+call[^fix-pr]>
 
 ## Prevention
-<the eval case added (evals/cases/<id>-<slug>/), the band or the test that would have caught
-it earlier, the CLAUDE.md line proposed, if any>
+<the eval case added[^eval], the band or the test that would have caught it earlier, the
+CLAUDE.md line proposed, if any>
+
+[^detection]: evidence/detection.json
+[^eval]: evals/cases/<id>-<slug>/
+[^fix-pr]: the build PR
